  "raw_text": "{\"changes\":[{\"path\":\"python_programs/minimum_spanning_tree.py\",\"edits\":[{\"old\":\"    for edge in sorted(weight_by_edge, key=weight_by_edge.__getitem__):\\n        u, v = edge\\n        if group_by_node.setdefault(u, {u}) != group_by_node.setdefault(v, {v}):\\n            mst_edges.add(edge)\\n            group_by_node[u].update(group_by_node[v])\\n            for node in group_by_node[v]:\\n                group_by_node[node].update(group_by_node[u])\\n\\n    return mst_edges\",\"new\":\"    for edge in sorted(weight_by_edge, key=weight_by_edge.__getitem__):\\n        u, v = edge\\n        group_by_node.setdefault(u, {u})\\n        group_by_node.setdefault(v, {v})\\n        if group_by_node.get(u, {u}) != group_by_node.get(v, {v}):\\n            mst_edges.add(edge)\\n            group_by_node[u].update(group_by_node[v])\\n            for node in group_by_node[v]:\\n                group_by_node[node].update(group_by_node[u])\\n\\n    return mst_edges\"}]}],\"explanation\":\"原实现在 if 条件里用 setdefault 作比较值，每次都会触发默认集合的构建，且两个不同节点比较的是不同的临时 set 对象，导致同一连通分量节点的归属集合无法正确合并，从而产生错误边集合。改为先确保每个节点存在于 group_by_node，再比较各自的集合归属，进行 Kruskal 合并，修复缺陷。\",\"evidence_ids\":[\"test-baseline\"],\"knowledge_citations\":[\"knowledge-public_tasks\",\"knowledge-testing\"]}",
